10 REM Shapes: a picture drawn with the SHAPES library.
20 INCLUDE SHAPES
30 CLS
40 C = 255
50 GOSUB SHAPES:2300
60 FOR I = 0 TO 5
70 X = 28 + I * 34 : Y = 40 : W = 24 : H = 48 : C = 40 + I * 36
80 GOSUB SHAPES:2000
90 NEXT I
100 FOR I = 0 TO 5
110 X = 40 + I * 34 : Y = 140 : R = 12 : C = 250 - I * 36
120 GOSUB SHAPES:2200
130 NEXT I
140 X = 128 : Y = 210 : R = 20 : C = 255
150 GOSUB SHAPES:2100
160 PRINT "DRAWN WITH SHAPES"
